        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions FII-SD-CUST-F 1-1/2\" Diameter Large Acrylic Glass Door Pulls</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nStunning design door pulls from the <a href=\"/collections/acrylic-collection\"><b>First Impressions Acrylic Collection</b></a>, combines the contemporary beauty of  Acrylic with Decorative bold solid brass mounting brackets. Made in the USA.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe acrylic is manufacture with UV inhibitors to prevent yellowing and fading. They are available in Crystal Clear or Frosted Acrylic. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for First Impressions FII-SD-CUST-F Large Acrylic Glass Door Pulls\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Clear or Frosted Acrylic</li>\r\n<li>Pull Bracket Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li><li>Door Mounting: 1/4\" to 1/2\" thick glass doors.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>FII-SD-CUST-F-1.5\"x20”</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 20\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Center to Center: 14-1/2\" C/C</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Bracket Width: 2-13/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Bracket Height: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>FII-SD-CUST-F-1.5\"x24”:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Center to Center: 18\" C/C</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Bracket Width: 2-13/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Bracket Height: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Custom Item. NO RETURNS</b>\r\n</p>",
